# The Python libraries that the guest image installs with pip. Debian packages
# the others (pypdf, pandas, numpy, packaging, python-dateutil, Pillow).
# matplotlib is here, and python-requirements.txt also pins the packages it
# needs that Debian does not give (contourpy, cycler, fonttools, kiwisolver,
# pyparsing). The Paper packages import as docx, openpyxl and pptx and replace
# python-docx, openpyxl and python-pptx: never install the upstream packages
# next to them.
